ent-RMCBeltMedicBagNV = M276-B pattern lifesaver bag
    .desc = The M276-B is a non-standard variant of the M276 pattern lifesaver rig used by the UNMC. The 'B' variant includes a light decrease in overall bulk due to a redesign of its' shape, and improved materials to prevent damage to the bag's contents while moving through dense foliage.
